#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.transform.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.transform"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:1 of
msgid "GroupBy.transform() -- per-group column transform."
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:3 of
msgid ""
"Applies ``func`` to each group independently and returns a LiteFrame with"
" the same row count as the input (transform semantics).  The output row "
"order follows reducer/hash-partition order and is not aligned with the "
"input frame."
msgstr ""
"独立地将 ``func`` 应用于每个组，并返回与输入具有相同行数的 LiteFrame（"
"变换语义）。输出行顺序遵循 reducer/hash-partition 顺序，与输入帧不对齐。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:8 of
msgid ""
"Function receiving a per-group column (Series) and returning a "
"transformed column of the same length.  ``func`` is called once per "
"(group, column) pair with a single-column Series, not a whole-group "
"DataFrame.  Use ``lambda g: g - g.mean()``, not ``g['col'] - "
"g['col'].mean()``.  If ``func`` is a class, it is instantiated once per "
"group, ``__call__`` is invoked per (group, column), and ``close()`` (if "
"defined) is always called at the end of each group."
msgstr ""
"接收每组列（Series）并返回相同长度的转换列的函数。``func`` 每个（组，列）"
"对调用一次，传入单列 Series，而不是整个组的 DataFrame。使用 ``lambda g: g"
" - g.mean()``，而不是 ``g['col'] - g['col'].mean()``。如果 ``func`` 是"
"一个类，则每个组实例化一次，每个（组，列）调用 ``__call__``，并且 ``close"
"()``（如果定义了）总是在每个组结束时调用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:18 of
msgid "Expected output dtypes."
msgstr "期望的输出数据类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:20 of
msgid "If True, skip dtype inference."
msgstr "如果为 True，则跳过数据类型推断。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:22 of
msgid "Frame type passed to ``func``."
msgstr "传递给 ``func`` 的帧类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:24 of
msgid "Extra positional arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外位置参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:26 of
msgid "Extra keyword arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外关键字参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:28 of
msgid ""
"Lazy LiteFrame with the same row count as the input, where each value is "
"the per-group transform result.  Call ``.execute()`` to materialize."
msgstr ""
"与输入具有相同行数的惰性 LiteFrame，其中每个值都是每组变换结果。调用 ``."
"execute()`` 来实例化。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:35 of
msgid ":py:obj:`groupby_apply`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:36 of
msgid "Apply a function to each group as a whole frame."
msgstr "将函数应用于每个组作为整个帧。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:38 of
msgid ":py:obj:`groupby_transform_chunk`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:39 of
msgid "Per-group-chunk transform."
msgstr "每组块变换。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:42 of
msgid "示例"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.transform.groupby_transform:46 of
msgid "Center each value by its group mean (row count preserved):"
msgstr "通过其组均值居中每个值（保留行数）："

